# Rust
target/
# Cargo.lock is NOT ignored: the root, GPUI, and GUI adapter lockfiles are
# committed on purpose. `cargo publish --locked` and the package verifiers
# read them, and the publish gate asserts that the root lockfile carries no
# `git+` source.
generated/*
!generated/README.md
!generated/manifest.json

